@SE 1376. Only some of the tip (of the nose).

Pipe. See <Tube>.

Pipe.; Fistula.
See <Flute>.

@AC 8337[4]. "Tabrets and pipes" (Ezekiel 28:13) = the affections (of good and truth), and the joys of these [affections].

