@--[2]. (The character and correspondence of a pirate.)

@DP 199. So a pirate, when he sees vessels.

@CL 511. They are like robbers and pirates...

@TCR 148. Like pirates, who on land are men; but at sea are crocodiles.

@317. To act the pirate in time of peace.

@380[4]. Like pirates who hang out the flag of a kingdom at peace; but when a ship approaches... hoist a piratical flag...

