@TCR 503. When the humour seized him...

@AE 1029[2]. If the Lord did not give them the Power to do all things at their pleasure.

Pleasure.; Voluptas.
Pleasure.; Volupe.
Voluptuous.; Voluptuosus.

@AC 45[end]. Lower things, which derive more from the body, are called "wild beasts," and are cupidities and pleasures.

